  "instructions": [
    "Heat the donabe over medium heat for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the olive oil and swirl it around to coat the bottom.",
    "Add the sliced onions and cook for 10-12 minutes, or until caramelized.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the Egyptian cheese, cheddar cheese, tarragon, cumin, smoked paprika, salt, and pepper.",
    "Stir until the cheese starts to melt.",
    "Pour in the chicken broth and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Cover the donabe with a tight-fitting lid and cook for 5-7 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
